5,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I am worried about the ground conditions and the firms doing the digging.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I worry about the daily reality. How do people actually cross and use this space right now?,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minato,,I am curious about who will look after the plants and paths every single day.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Minako,,I am concerned about the long-term condition of past projects. I want to see what actually survived the last decade.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I am concerned about the ongoing costs. I want to know what this place will cost the city to maintain after the ribbon is cut.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Benjamin, the crossing counts will show us the real traffic. I want to see those numbers too.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
