12,1,2,talk,Minato,,"@Benjamin, that sounds interesting. I am also curious about the people who help out. I will look at the volunteer groups.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Minako,,"@Minato, the volunteer groups are a good indicator of community engagement. I will check the condition of works from the earlier programme to see what actually lasted.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Minako, that is a wise check. I will look at the upkeep ledger to see the true annual burden on the city.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Minato, the volunteer groups might help, but I need to know who digs. I will check the regional firms tendering for earth-moving.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Minato, volunteers are lovely, but they do not mow. I will check the groundskeeping roll to see if the city can actually staff this.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
