20,1,4,talk,Kenji,,I will also check the depot phasing notes. I need to see how they plan to hoard the site without chaos.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,I will also check the record of the eastern avenue planting. I need to see if the ground actually supports what we propose.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Minato,,I will also look at the volunteer groups. I want to see if they are still active and happy to help.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
